ance overhaul for listed firms — does not address bank capital adequacy.", "source": "TBS", "changed": false, "headline": "BSEC's new governance code: Right diagnosis, incomplete prescription", "held_from": null, "source_url": "https://www.tbsnews.net/economy/bsecs-new-governance-code-right-diagnosis-incomplete-prescription-1449016", "published_at": "2026-05-27T00:30:01.918489+00:00"}, {"id": "67df508f-0586-4edc-bef8-05020ae8b216", "ord": 1, "tone": "warn", "detail": "Banking sector conditionality expected — recapitalization timeline likely accelerates.", "source": "TBS", "changed": true, "headline": "Bangladesh, IMF agree on new realistic three-year reform programme", "held_from": null, "source_url": "https://www.tbsnews.net/economy/govt-officially-scraps-al-era-imf-loan-deal-seeks-fresh-5b-package-1448201", "published_at": "2026-05-27T00:30:01.918489+00:00"}], "slug": "banking", "tldr": "NPL and CAR unchanged on Q4 print; IMF reshapes recapitalization timeline.", "notes": [], "title": "Banking", "series": [], "weight": 1, "metrics": [{"id": "d4b5252e-20f1-4dc7-9416-a2ec24762504", "ord": 0, "sub": "Q4 2025 print · pending Q1 2026 disclosure", "tone": "bear", "delta": null, "label": "NPL Ratio", "spark": null, "value": "35.73%", "weight": 2, "changed": false, "delta_pct": null, "held_from": null, "next_print": null, "is_snapshot": false}, {"id": "176739de-f17c-41c5-9c2b-fceb171e7a8e", "ord": 1, "sub": "Below Basel III 10.5% · Q4 2025 · dividend bar threshold", "tone": "bear", "delta": null, "label": "CAR", "spark": null, "value": "1.56%", "weight": 2, "changed": false, "delta_pct": null, "held_from": null, "next_print": null, "is_snapshot": false}], "verdict": "NPL 35.73%, CAR 1.56% — Q4 print held; Q1 disclosure pending.", "analysis": "NPL at 35.73% and CAR at 1.56% — both Q4 2025 prints, held pending Q1 disclosure. The IMF agreement on a new 3-year reform programme shifts the structural calculus: conditionality will almost certainly include recapitalization targets and NPL resolution timelines that the system has deferred since the crisis deepened. Government bank borrowing crossing the annual target in nine months compounds the pressure — the sovereign balance sheet that would fund bank rescues is itself under fiscal strain. The binding constraint remains circular: the fiscal authority must recapitalize banks it cannot afford to recapitalize while borrowing from the very banking system it needs to rescue. Zero duration on bank paper until Q1 data prints and IMF conditionality terms clarify.", "brief_id": "bb0581b8-752f-4361-96c2-8a54b4718572", "freshness": "fresh", "group_key": "banking", "banker_read": {"risk": ["Lending into 35.73% NPL creates adverse selection trap", "IMF-mandated recapitalization pressures an already strained fiscal balance sheet"], "watch": ["Q1 2026 NPL/CAR disclosure — first post-crisis quarterly print", "IMF banking conditionality terms and recapitalization timeline"], "runway": {"unit": "mo buffer", "value": "0"}, "verdict": "NPL at 35.73% and CAR at 1.56% on the Q4 2025 print — pending Q1 disclosure. IMF 3-year programme conditionality will impose recapitalization timelines the system has been deferring since the crisis deepened."}, "verdict_tone": "warn", "summary_pills": [{"key": "NPL", "tone": "bear", "value": "35.73%"}, {"key": "CAR", "tone": "bear", "value": "1.56%"}]}, {"id": "2e8f32a6-1d7c-43f3-bd75-82a6a083ee08", "ord": 5, "news": [], "slug": "fx", "tldr": "Taka anchored at 122.75; crude at $94 eases import-bill arithmetic.", "notes": [], "title": "FX & External", "series": [{"ts": "2026-05-02", "key": "monthly_export", "value": 3.64748}, {"ts": "2026-05-02", "key": "monthly_remittance", "value": 2.88949}, {"ts": "2026-05-02", "key": "monthly_import", "value": 3.48163}, {"ts": "2026-05-03", "key": "monthly_export", "value": 3.65}, {"ts": "2026-05-03", "key": "monthly_import", "value": 3.48163}, {"ts": "2026-05-03", "key": "monthly_remittance", "value": 2.89}, {"ts": "2026-05-04", "key": "m